        "language": "english",
        "review": "I didn't know what to expect going into this game but it's actually super fun. It's hilarious all the random antics and the narrator is amazing. It has the same vibes as the Stanley Parable in terms of the game gags from the jokes, to removing objects and mocking you when you fail too many times. \n\nIt's short and sweet, something you can easily finish in one sitting and just have fun with. It's about 5 chapters long and there are various options to make so you can play through it multiple times to get the full amount of content. \n\nThe graphics are straightforward but it adds to the feel of the game. Rag-dolling will always make me laugh.",
